  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The OSI Chem Screen is a significant improvement over traditional chemical treating methods. OSI’s proprietary, micro-encapsulation technology allows the most effective oilfield treatment chemistry to be put into solid stick form, placed into specifically engineered tools and installed below the pump intake.",
   "box": {
    "x": 598,
    "y": 225,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 101
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "With the treating chemicals placed downhole, the activation and dispersal of the chemicals occur much faster and more efficiently. Where multiple screens are used, a SHUT OFF VALVE between each section prevents premature dispersal. The treatment process is continual, over a longer period ensuring a more cost-effective treatment program.",
   "box": {
    "x": 598,
    "y": 351,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 126
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The Chem Screen is engineered for durability so that, in most cases, it can be refilled when needed.",
   "box": {
    "x": 598,
    "y": 502,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 50
   }
  },
